{"story_id":11864,"updated_at":"2026-10-08T02:48:58","headline_en":"Maker police station officer suspended after pointing gun at flood victims","headline_hi":"बाढ़ पीड़ितों पर बंदूक तानने के बाद मकेर पुलिस स्टेशन के अधिकारी को निलंबित किया गया","payload_en":{"story_id":11864,"headline":"Maker police station officer suspended after pointing gun at flood victims","counts":{"outlets":11,"articles":11,"independent_sources":7},"has_established":true,"qualified_by":"perspectives","perspective_mode":"story","perspectives":{"A*":["Aaj Tak","Hindustan Times","Lokmat News Hindi","News18","SSBCrack","The Indian Express","The Tribune"],"B*":["The Hindu"]},"framing":[{"id":33059,"text":"A Sub-Inspector and Station House Officer of Maker Police Station pointed a gun at flood victims and showed them footwear during the distribution of relief materials.","words":{"A*":["allegedly","brandishing","पिस्तौल तानते हुए","शर्मनाक","हैरान करने वाला"],"B*":["arbitrary behaviour","gross negligence","indiscipline"]}}],"suicide":false,"thread":11864,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-10-08T02:48:58","category":{"primary":["justice"],"secondary":["police"]},"places":["bihar"],"people":["Anil Kumar Singh","Appu Singh","Sangram Kumar Singh","other residents","some residents","Parshurampur","Water Resources Department official","Aam Aadmi Party"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"ids":[33059],"text":"A Sub-Inspector and Station House Officer of Maker Police Station pointed a gun at flood victims and showed them footwear during the distribution of relief materials.","class":"established","sources":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7]}],[{"ids":[35394],"text":"Heavy rainfall occurred in Nepal and neighbouring areas in the last week of September.","class":"single","sources":[5]},{"ids":[35395],"text":"Saran and adjoining districts experienced flood stress.","class":"single","sources":[5]}],[{"ids":[33083,38254,33065],"text":"Nearly 9.87 lakh people in 169 gram panchayats across 30 blocks in six Bihar districts have been affected by floods following heavy rains in late September, but over 47 lakh people have been affected by floods across 87 blocks of 15 districts in Bihar.","class":"disputed","sources":[1,2,3,4,5,7]}],[{"ids":[33071],"text":"A Water Resources Department official stated that laxity and delays were found in the emergency response by some engineers, including inadequate mobilisation of manpower and materials and poor coordination with locals and elected representatives.","class":"single","sources":[7]}],[{"ids":[33076],"text":"Sangram Kumar Singh was suspended from his position on October 6, 2026.","class":"unverified","sources":[1,2,3,4,5,6]},{"ids":[35371],"text":"An inquiry was ordered into the circumstances shown in the footage of Sangram Kumar Singh.","class":"single","sources":[5]},{"ids":[35369],"text":"An argument occurred between police personnel and residents at Rewa Ghat.","class":"single","sources":[5]},{"ids":[35280],"text":"A large crowd had become agitated at the location before the officer pulled out his pistol.","class":"unverified","sources":[3,4]}],[{"ids":[33080],"text":"Saran Senior Superintendent of Police stated that the incident reflects gross negligence of duty, indiscipline and arbitrariness.","class":"unverified","sources":[1,2,3,4,5,6]},{"ids":[33062,33067],"text":"The Opposition Rashtriya Janata Dal attacked the State government over the incident by posting a message on X along with the video of the SI, saying that those in power are treating common people like insects, flashing shoes at flood victims and whipping out a pistol with swagger.","class":"single","sources":[7]},{"ids":[35282],"text":"The Aam Aadmi Party criticized the police for the alleged use of firearms against flood victims and young protesters.","class":"unverified","sources":[3,4]}],[{"ids":[33063],"text":"The State government suspended seven engineers and initiated departmental proceedings against another official for negligence in handling floods.","class":"single","sources":[7]},{"ids":[38259],"text":"Flooding in Saran has affected over 3 lakh people and disrupted road access to several areas.","class":"single","sources":[6]}],[{"ids":[35374,38258,38260],"text":"Anil Kumar Singh, also known as Appu Singh, died in Parshurampur during an airdrop of flood relief material on October 2 while residents were collecting packets dropped from an Indian Air Force helicopter.","class":"single","sources":[5,6]},{"ids":[35377],"text":"A woman and children were injured during the collection of relief packets in Parshurampur on October 2.","class":"single","sources":[5]},{"ids":[35387,35389],"text":"Some residents said a relief bag struck Anil Kumar Singh, while other residents said he suffered a heart attack when material landed nearby.","class":"single","sources":[5]}],[{"ids":[35392],"text":"The cause of death of Anil Kumar Singh will be established by post-mortem.","class":"single","sources":[5]}]],"section_keys":["news","background","background","explained","happened","say","related","related","next"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://www.aajtak.in/bihar/story/saran-flood-sho-sangram-kumar-singh-brandishing-pistol-at-flood-hit-people-during-distribution-of-relief-materials-video-lcly-strc-2661489-2026-10-05","read":true,"title":"बिहार: बाढ़ पीड़ितों पर पुलिसकर्मी ने तान दी पिस्टल, VIDEO वायरल","outlet":"Aaj Tak","readable":true,"perspective":"A*"},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/india-news/bihar-cop-suspended-for-brandishing-pistol-at-people-during-flood-relief-distribution-101791169952245.html","read":true,"title":"Bihar cop suspended for brandishing pistol at people during flood relief distribution","outlet":"Hindustan Times","readable":true,"perspective":"A*"},{"n":3,"url":"https://www.lokmatnews.in/india/bihar-policeman-suspended-for-brandishing-pistol-at-flood-victims-opposition-goes-on-offensive-after-video-goes-viral-b668/","read":true,"title":"Bihar: बाढ़ पीड़ितों पर पुलिसकर्मी के पिस्तौल दिखाने पर एक्शन, हुआ निलं