-victim-during-distribution-of-relief-materials-in-bihars-saran/article71545906.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Over 47 lakh people have been affected by floods across 87 blocks of 15 districts in Bihar.","verdict":"disputed","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/bihar/si-suspended-for-pointing-pistol-at-flood-victim-during-distribution-of-relief-materials-in-bihars-saran/article71545906.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Anil Kumar Singh, also known as Appu Singh, died in Parshurampur while residents were collecting packets dropped from an Indian Air Force helicopter","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"SSBCrack","url":"https://www.ssbcrack.com/2026/10/bihar-police-sho-suspended-after-pointing-pistol-at-flood-victims-during-relief-distribution.html","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"A woman and children were injured during the collection of relief packets in Parshurampur","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"SSBCrack","url":"https://www.ssbcrack.com/2026/10/bihar-police-sho-suspended-after-pointing-pistol-at-flood-victims-during-relief-distribution.html","stance":"attributes"}]},{"text":"A relief bag struck Anil Kumar Singh","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"SSBCrack","url":"https://www.ssbcrack.com/2026/10/bihar-police-sho-suspended-after-pointing-pistol-at-flood-victims-during-relief-distribution.html","stance":"attributes"}]},{"text":"Anil Kumar Singh suffered a heart attack when material landed nearby","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"SSBCrack","url":"https://www.ssbcrack.com/2026/10/bihar-police-sho-suspended-after-pointing-pistol-at-flood-victims-during-relief-distribution.html","stance":"attributes"}]},{"text":"Anil Kumar Singh died during an airdrop of flood relief material.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Indian Express","url":"https://indianexpress.com/article/india/saran-f